514	    /**
515	     * Returns true if the parameter list of g is more specific than or equal
516	     * to the parameter list of f.  If any of g's parameters fails to be more
517	     * specific than the corresponding parameter of f (using the
518	     * "tweakedSubtypeTest"), then returns false.
519	     * 
520	     * @param f
521	     * @param g
522	     * @return
